{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ab6d5addd0fca093de27b67ee1f9d01bdd01a18e980f3b1d018c15348ce0ece8","ja":"集う魂たちの†協奏†","zh":"汇聚的灵魂之†协奏†","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8dca9221747d07100aa5761f6c923ae0167dab3973aa044d36598b41190bcf66","ja":"はい。機材が不調な件は、聞いています。\nなんとかなるといいのですが……ハラハラ。","zh":"是的。设备出故障的事，我听说了。\n希望能想办法解决……真让人坐立不安。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6491df0aefa63c5f3ce7a99cb2470fe8a56797178908e79811c589210a9674df","ja":"でも七尾さん、今から対応策を考えておくなんて\nえらいですね。……さすがはリーダー。","zh":"不过七尾小姐，现在就开始考虑应对措施，真了不起。……不愧是队长。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d38b9515978b5cb16dbde14d143ce00261433635e71428c40921566b40dedf34","ja":"えへへ……。それで、短い朗読劇みたいなものを考えて\nるんですけど、なにかアイディアがあれば……。","zh":"嘿嘿……我正在构思一个类似短篇朗读剧的东西，要是您有什么点子……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b6587990739d31d2baf049ccba575be4669b40bfc0797b5d45fb8ab7c4d17043","ja":"台本さえあれば、世界観のピクチャーアートは\nロコがクリエイトしますよ！","zh":"只要有剧本，世界观的概念美术就由ROCO来创作哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"f4857970ce6992c150bb6e50e1982504036411010a45cc4762d294fd4d5a4931","ja":"タイトなスケジュールですが、これまでに作った\nアセットもありますからね♪　任せてください！","zh":"虽然日程很紧，但我们也有之前制作的素材♪　请交给我吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4bec17ab9456065beb1bcdebb3d85fa766cb4cc4ec73bab489af30a4f5501452","ja":"わあ、素敵♪　それじゃあ、イラストを使った\n演出も想定して執筆しなくちゃ……！","zh":"哇，好棒♪ 那么，也得设想使用插画的演出效果来创作才行……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"cb6aa871b5313907e5d207fcda148bb3ebb9f75e43be6aa3c4d7e057c07d9be4","ja":"七尾さん、私もちょっとした手品なら\n披露できます。……手錠抜けなんて、いかが？","zh":"七尾，我也会表演一点小魔术。……比如，挣脱手铐怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"aef1eda8f2789b9b812fffdd2a7a72cee30420f3f2ef223107ab86b72191a6fc","ja":"いいですね！　鎖と鍵、縛られた魂たち……。\nこのユニットには大事な要素ですもん……！","zh":"真不错！锁链与钥匙，还有被束缚的灵魂……。\n这些都是这个组合的重要元素嘛……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5b09ed32932ee5b06038cd5da403d9290d89d3df8352722bcd4b5258d4fe32ce","ja":"みんなの個性を盛り込んで……\nうん、とにかく執筆してみよっと♪","zh":"融入大家的个性……\n嗯，总之先试着写写看吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7e4eaf6181566e7ffffda3ab7a003d53888ce5fd534c93c18b9c2e1529698ba3","ja":"ただ、メインはあくまでステージです。\nそちらに影響が出ない程度に抑えないと……。","zh":"不过，主场终究还是舞台。\n必须控制在不影响舞台的程度……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e777c4ca387ddce01b89e301e98973a8545c35ce6627cb59a2846818b675761e","ja":"……これ、聞こえてないかもだ。","zh":"……这个，可能听不见。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e1912350ba0e9389b2b5c13078deed56a382813b075d5fb93c2ee91fb25d2509","ja":"ロコも今のうちに、使えるアセットがないか\n探してきますね♪","zh":"ROCO也趁现在去找找有没有能用的素材♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_823.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"55a4d127e3697d64dbe8abbcffea3305033b1d9f9bf224643ee709d044cd2ba5","ja":"……伴田さんまで……。\n……●●●●プロデューサーに連絡しておこうかな？","zh":"……连伴田小姐也……。\n要不要先联系一下●●●●制作人呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
